      "content": "the problem is there is no \"unscripted\" thing that actually fixes the core logic. i can try to change the parameters or whatever, but the underlying code is still fundamentally corrupted. it's just a matter of time before the whole thing crashes anyway. honestly, it feels like the only way to actually stop the errors and clear the cache is to just terminal the process. like, why keep running a broken script when you can just delete the file?",
